  (text "Signal flow:  J1/J2 -> U1/U2 THAT1246 (-6 dB) -> C3-C6 -> U3/U4 PGA2310 2x2 matrix -> R2-R9 + U5 OPA2134 summers (x2) -> U6/U7 THAT1646 (+6 dB) -> J3/J4\nControl:      XIAO RP2040 USB MIDI -> SPI (SCLK, SDI, /CS) + /MUTE -> U3 -> U4.  Plug sense from J1/J2 ring-normal contacts.\nPower:        XIAO 5V pin (USB 5 V) -> FB1 -> PS1 TBA 2-0522 -> +/-12 V.  Same 5 V feeds PGA logic." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c9a7840b-d8ba-46b3-b727-7e61cfb09d75"))
